Geist.ttf is a decompressed TrueType copy of geist-latin-wght-normal.woff2
from @fontsource-variable/geist 5.3.0, the same font used by Pinmeter's UI.
No glyph outlines were changed. Container conversion: fontTools TTFont,
font.flavor = None. Source: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/geist
License: Geist.LICENSE (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
The font is embedded and loaded in-process by DirectWrite, never installed.
